---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Terms of use">
  <article class="content-page">
    <p class="eyebrow">THE PRACTICAL DETAILS</p>
    <h1>Terms of use</h1>
    <p class="privacy-meta">Effective 31 October 2026</p>
    <p>
      By using Ahab, you agree to these terms. Ahab provides tools to create
      AI-generated portraits and videos using your instructions and references.
    </p>
    <h2>Your account and materials</h2>
    <p>
      Keep your password and optional recovery passcode safe. Only upload
      material you own or have permission to use, including permission to use a
      person’s face or voice. Do not impersonate someone without consent, create
      unlawful content, or misrepresent generated footage as a real person’s
      genuine testimonial or experience.
    </p>
    <h2>Purchases and generation allowances</h2>
    <p>
      Allowances are one-time purchases in USD. Buy one or several, then use
      them separately whenever you are ready. Payment does not start generation.
      One video consumes one video allowance, including when you choose a
      shorter compatible duration. Unused seconds do not form a seconds wallet.
      Each successful image preparation consumes one image allowance. Service,
      selected duration, bonus generation target, resolution and final price are
      shown before checkout. Allowances do not expire. Existing paid packages
      retain their purchased limits.
    </p>
    <h2>Failures and final purchases</h2>
    <p>
      A confirmed technical generation failure restores the relevant allowance.
      A successful portrait is not restored because a later video fails.
      Purchases are final; Ahab does not offer voluntary cash refunds. Nothing
      in these terms excludes rights or remedies that cannot be excluded under
      applicable law.
    </p>
    <h2>Generated results</h2>
    <p>
      AI results can contain errors, unexpected visual details or imperfect
      timing. Exact likeness, object handling, spoken timing, creative
      preferences and commercial results are not guaranteed. Review output and
      substantiate product claims before publishing. Follow the disclosure and
      advertising rules that apply to your use.
    </p>
    <h2>Storage and availability</h2>
    <p>
      Per account, Ahab keeps up to 80 saved prompts, 40 images, 20 audio
      uploads, 10 video references and 23 generated videos. Adding beyond a
      limit removes the oldest item in that category. Generated videos also
      expire after 121 days. Download finished work you want to keep.
      Availability may depend on upstream service operation and funding.
    </p>
    <h2>Content removal and account access</h2>
    <p>
      Unlawful or abusive use may lead to content removal or restricted access.
      Media you delete or that reaches a retention limit is removed from your
      library and queued for storage deletion. Processing copies may remain
      briefly while an active job or deletion retry completes.
    </p>
    <h2>Questions about a purchase</h2>
    <p>
      Keep your purchase record and use the merchant contact details shown on
      your Stripe receipt to raise a payment or service issue. These terms apply
      subject to mandatory law.
    </p>
  </article>
</Layout>
